# What must not travel into the build context.
#
# node_modules first and for the obvious reason — the image installs its own from the
# lockfile, and a Windows or macOS tree copied in would carry native bindings that do
# not run on alpine.

node_modules
.next
out
next-env.d.ts
*.tsbuildinfo

# Real configuration. The image is built once and configured at run time; a .env.local
# baked into a layer is a credential in an image registry.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local

# Not needed to build or serve.
Dockerfile
.dockerignore
.gitignore

# Tests are deliberately NOT excluded. `next build` runs tsc over what is in the context,
# and a context missing the test files would type-check less than CI does.
